      "content": "\"something new\" sounds like such a lie. how can you build anything on nothing? there's no \"new chapter\" when the whole book is just blank. it doesn't feel like \"embracing uncertainty,\" it just feels like there's nothing left to hold onto. i feel like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to disappear too.",
