      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like the effort of even trying to \"write a sentence\" is just more weight i can't carry. if there's no foundation, why does everything keep insisting i have to stay? it feels like i'm being forced to exist in a vacuum. it would be so much easier to just stop fighting the emptiness and just... let it take over.",
